:"I find repetitive jobs boring. I'm not keen","h":0.011915269196822731,"x":0.15226338809262274,"y":0.42277140336469077},{"text":"on children and I have a dog.","x":0.15432099543384184,"w":0.20164608001708981,"y":0.43895348840426829,"h":0.011627906839719149},{"text":"Mia","y":0.51162790724841589,"w":0.051440329551696778,"h":0.017441859838716267,"x":0.22016460925413397},{"h":0.01464704865390809,"y":0.53139790564688438,"text":"I'd like a job where I can be active.","w":0.24725473403930665,"x":0.21995866162731054},{"w":0.24691356658935548,"h":0.013255864671133044,"x":0.22016461972315482,"text":"I love water sports and am good at","y":0.54633715813175765},{"x":0.22016460822501913,"w":0.24279834747314452,"y":0.56250000040447368,"h":0.013081394879037256,"text":"problem-solving. I get on well with"},{"text":"children, but I'm scared of dogs.","x":0.21996559506129232,"y":0.57786703687811802,"h":0.01502509592701029,"w":0.23288928985595703},{"h":0.010211621778577484,"y":0.59443954103732077,"text":"Free accommodation would be great.","w":0.26131687164306644,"x":0.22222222522784946},{"x":0.17901234735172727,"y":0.68168604687944823,"w":0.045267486572265647,"text":"Felix","h":0.015988370957673359},{"h":0.010363000110515053,"text":"I'd like to live somewhere","w":0.15226336479187014,"y":0.70058139550225107,"x":0.17901235203479188},{"y":0.71656976769217351,"h":0.01026165348601793,"w":0.12757201194763185,"text":"new, but I don't have","x":0.17901235006184929},{"h":0.013081394879037256,"x":0.17901234596747248,"y":0.73110465117966739,"w":0.16255144119262691,"text":"money for a flat. I'm active,"},{"x":0.17873311757134602,"text":"spend lots of time outdoors","y":0.74567317727621518,"w":0.16508586883544923,"h":0.013268145016622213},{"text":"and love water sports. I enjoy being alone","w":0.25102880477905276,"x":0.17901235076548033,"y":0.76162790694835747,"h":0.011627906839719149},{"x":0.17901234960333415,"h":0.011662544240387596,"y":0.77758164168916188,"text":"and jobs which aren't too challenging.","w":0.22839506149291991},{"w":0.16049383163452144,"x":0.17901234544817132,"text":"I haven'tworked with kids.","y":0.79346866740610678,"h":0.01031040198384181},{"w":0.070372271537780764,"y":0.86126412860386281,"text":"LOSSARY","x":0.11913485258258526,"h":0.01293685892884533},{"y":0.88372093038827992,"h":0.011689484487669932,"w":0.35802467346191402,"text":"first aid (n) - simple medical treatment given straight","x":0.12345679549126523},{"text":"after an accident","w":0.11522633552551269,"h":0.0088261253309797061,"y":0.90114739647482778,"x":0.12345679252530946},{"w":0.34586471557617188,"text":"to rescue (v) - to save someone or something from","x":0.12335629221178344,"y":0.91117358861042252,"h":0.013326826289177807},{"h":0.011924805098261659,"x":0.1254450279093465,"w":0.04952146530151369,"text":"danger","y":0.92863062051743406},{"w":0.026748969554901136,"x":0.10905349909600623,"h":0.011627906839719149,"text":"78","y":0.95784883724147762},{"text":"@00","x":0.54938271682581963,"h":0.0087209299193581336,"w":0.030864195823669394,"y":0.050872093070844171},{"y":0.071955077955812352,"w":0.16713344573974609,"h":0.029054959895646659,"x":0.56972545886477322,"text":"Looking for"},{"w":0.23671426773071291,"h":0.027997689444936635,"text":"a summer job?","x":0.56991447170425724,"y":0.094286039196739391},{"h":0.01191526919682262,"text":"Read on to find out about the most","w":0.28395061492919926,"x":0.57201646227134006,"y":0.13503971742060206},{"x":0.57175599080010497,"w":0.30080581665039063,"y":0.14713550937864628,"text":"popular summer work for teenagers.","h":0.014584079213828427},{"x":0.55555555747729846,"h":0.013239187996469615,"text":"A LIFEGUARD","w":0.11522633552551265,"y":0.1685789938786002},{"y":0.18248696144008092,"w":0.32958663940429689,"x":0.57183349301894426,"h":0.014512906322832753,"text":"Being a lifeguard is the perfect way to spend time on"},{"text":"the beach and learn new skills like first aid* and water","w":0.34202877044677737,"y":0.19491857263928192,"x":0.56971678955512939,"h":0.016567678022258447},{"x":0.56978075007420059,"y":0.21057866863681307,"w":0.33164367675781248,"text":"rescue*. You must be a strong swimmer to cope with","h":0.013979231690476657},{"text":"big waves, and a reliable person. It's a serious job and","w":0.34199451446533202,"x":0.57180702053344623,"y":0.22410895547226695,"h":0.015937446600972072},{"x":0.56971442365708225,"h":0.016236378466882972,"text":"you don't know what's going to happen each day. It's","y":0.2382430802707779,"w":0.33382190704345704},{"x":0.57173738754989412,"h":0.016503705246092903,"text":"only for those who have a passion for water. You also","y":0.25200605559250278,"w":0.33389690399169925},{"x":0.56995884391406659,"text":"need to live near the coast.","y":0.27034883765341378,"w":0.17283950805664061,"h":0.010321947924352148},{"y":0.28488372129805284,"x":0.55967078008572302,"h":0.016087152425525275,"text":"B CAMP COUNSELLOR*","w":0.18518518447875976},{"w":0.32365196228027349,"h":0.018144223717388996,"text":"Are you a good leader? Do you find it easy to make","x":0.57169562738449642,"y":0.29786703740091958},{"x":0.57201645913422505,"y":0.31540697689990782,"w":0.34979423522949227,"h":0.01162790683971926,"text":"decisions? The camp counsellor job involves organising"},{"h":0.013239187996469504,"x":0.5720164647828655,"y":0.32833186234743295,"w":0.34567901611328122,"text":"activities as well as helping children with any problems,"},{"x":0.571799537878103,"h":0.016106695594349962,"y":0.34126009212835884,"text":"so it's essential you are caring. This job is well-paid and","w":0.35028392791748053},{"h":0.01191526919682262,"x":0.5740740864295989,"w":0.33539093017578125,"text":"accommodation is included, but you have to be ready","y":0.35745807607950364},{"x":0.57180584174416593,"h":0.016384979948361966,"y":0.36984240694524662,"text":"for anything. You must be hard-working and be ready to","w":0.3502629089355469},{"y":0.38593446183615887,"w":0.18566974639892575,"text":"work with adults and children.","h":0.012700344331477043,"x":0.57378222375891452},{"w":0.23251028060913081,"h":0.013081394879037367,"text":"C WINDSURFING INSTRUCTOR","x":0.56172840072767061,"y":0.40406976759197355},{"x":0.57376907701281354,"text":"If you already have some skills, then take a course and","w":0.34629447937011715,"h":0.018002521013224526,"y":0.41549537609262932},{"x":0.57407407929883403,"y":0.4315975287495506,"w":0.34979423522949216,"text":"become a windsurfing instructor. You need to be patient","h":0.013239187996469504},{"text":"as most people you teach will be beginners. You also","y":0.44446658683203566,"w":0.3340054702758789,"x":0.57374394622036518,"h":0.018325339348465586},{"y":0.46029118883843745,"text":"have to be sociable because you are going to work with","h":0.015115014031621521,"x":0.57388952922084169,"w":0.35018833160400398},{"h":0.013239187996469615,"x":0.5740740827675398,"y":0.47528684899501417,"w":0.33127571105957032,"text":"adults and kids all day long. If you live near a lake or"},{"w":0.21810699462890615,"x":0.57407407833712432,"y":0.4911738747482961,"h":0.011915269196822509,"text":"sea then this is a good job for you."},{"x":0.56584362149846379,"w":0.11316872596740724,"text":"O PET SITTER","h":0.014741425375336625,"y":0.50706090017718419},{"text":"Taking care of people's pets when they go on holiday","x":0.57592784575912104,"y":0.52133214612786483,"w":0.33576843261718747,"h":0.015414126868386946},{"w":0.35026493072509757,"y":0.534659251314894,"text":"is a great summer job for animal lovers. You need to be","h":0.016936511774559682,"x":0.57387271313260246},{"h":0.015536127317719806,"y":0.55007083853863181,"w":0.34819324493408199,"x":0.57589604318934151,"text":"active as the job can include walking dogs and cleaning"},{"y":0.56531332725062977,"text":"animal cages*. The pay isn't great, but sometimes you","w":0.34156375885009771,"h":0.013239187996469504,"x":0.57613169830128863},{"y":0.57837249473676866,"text":"can live for free in the same house as the animals you","x":0.57591952619837372,"w":0.33991180419921874,"h":0.013941268213849556},{"x":0.57613167992837189,"h":0.011665110238757825,"y":0.59443954086307094,"text":"are looking after, so it is possible to save some money.","w":0.33950618743896488},{"text":"E GARDENER","h":0.014736294220320856,"w":0.11316872596740724,"y":0.61191860468972725,"x":0.56172839308625522},{"y":0.6264534884858689,"text":"Another option for nature-lovers is looking after","h":0.013081394879037256,"w":0.29629629135131841,"x":0.57818930782228306},{"text":"people's gardens when they go on holiday, or helping","x":0.57585982569294913,"y":0.63953649462230433,"w":0.33586009979248044,"h":0.016153872591777918},{"y":0.65397157216038859,"text":"them if they are too busy at work. It's important that","x":0.5758925610395661,"h":0.015676390672298313,"w":0.32766471862792979},{"h":0.018590080348769855,"w":0.33606937408447268,"x":0.57573112878781019,"text":"you know about different plants and trees and how to","y":0.66655695297949891},{"text":"care for them. There's plenty of alone-time in this job,","y":0.68223185720859403,"h":0.015104788757485887,"x":0.57794176070070657,"w":0.33379692077636725},{"h":0.01191526919682262,"text":"so it's good for quiet people.","w":0.17695472717285154,"y":0.69902912627378089,"x":0.57818930477777175},{"w":0.17078187942504885,"h":0.016328331862312417,"y":0.71491615176610102,"text":"F ACTIVITY LEADER","x":0.55555556062183764},{"w":0.35026645660400391,"h":0.016464043168609166,"x":0.57794544845440587,"text":"You have to love kids to do this job. You also need to be","y":0.72913612501393532},{"text":"good at a wide variety of different sports and activities","y":0.74229101975748069,"h":0.018043652742390948,"x":0.57780657789717327,"w":0.34226100921630853},{"w":0.32566234588623044,"x":0.57792560591498743,"y":0.75824787687484507,"h":0.016523218112820981,"text":"such as volleyball and painting. This job is for active"},{"text":"and adventurous people only. So, if swimming in a river","y":0.7731685789547289,"h":0.013239187996469504,"x":0.57818930467973872,"w":0.34773662567138675},{"w":0.31536550521850593,"h":0.016693918239933492,"text":"is not your favourite activity, then this is not the job","x":0.57797732186443307,"y":0.7863961528018224},{"w":0.33590122222900398,"text":"for you. The money isn't great, but accommodation is","h":0.01698468874117387,"x":0.57797476561755312,"y":0.80029763417295341},{"y":0.81976744225612697,"h":0.010329645077738259,"x":0.57818930272393887,"w":0.08024690628051756,"text":"usually free."},{"y":0.8777581643518364,"text":"counsellor (n) - a job where someone gives advice","w":0.33950614929199219,"x":0.54938272357931273,"h":0.013239187996469615},{"h":0.013239187996469504,"x":0.54938271946232542,"y":0.89232127090894819,"w":0.25102880477905276,"text":"and helps people with their problems"},{"text":"cage (n) - a box with thin metal bars for keeping small","y":0.90342716087660568,"x":0.54907064528248894,"w":0.36284378051757815,"h":0.019498387376292059},{"h":0.010368131265530822,"text":"animals or birds","w":0.10905349731445313,"y":0.92277140324069673,"x":0.54938271772651825}]